title: RuzicaHouse
// Corresponds to scene 4 in the narrative script
// This scene is from Ruzica's POV
// Ruzica and Jovan are the characters in these scene
// Ruzica is character 1, Jovan is character 2
---
<<declare $lover2Name = "Ruzica">>
<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 0>>
<<changeBG 1>>
{$lover1Name} climbs through the window into {$lover2Name}'s room, she's scared.
<<twoChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 0>>
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name} checks behind him to see if anyone saw him.
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: Did anyone see you?
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name} picks up her hand and places it in his.
{$lover1Name}: I don't know. Maybe. I don't think so.
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name} keeps checking the door, constantly looking if they're safe.
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name} grabs her hand tighter.
{$lover1Name}: Everything will be okay.
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: How can you be sure? If anyone sees you here…
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: I know. But I don't think anyone saw me.
They turn their heads to the window after hearing voices outside.
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}:(Eyes tearing up) I am really scared. I can't live like this anymore.
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: I know. But there is nothing we can do now but see each other like this.
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: I wish we could just go away together.
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: Where would we go?
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: Just away. I don't care, as long as we don't have to live like this anymore.
<<darken 1>>

<<lighten 2>>
{$lover1Name}: Are you sure about this? What would we even need to bring?
<<darken 2>>

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name} picks up her large bag and starts pushing clothes inside.
{$lover2Name}: (Determined) I am sure. Help me pack things.
<<darken 1>>

They both start packing her essentials into the bag. 
They pause after hearing a voice from outside her door.

{$lover2Name}'s Mom: (Yelling from another room) {$lover2Name}, are you talking to somebody? Who's in the room with you?

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}:(Rushed) No one, Mom. Just talking to myself.
<<darken 1>>

{$lover2Name}'s Mom: Do you need something?

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: No, no. Everything is okay.
<<darken 1>>

They both pause packing for a moment after hearing {$lover2Name}'s Mom walking toward her room. 

{$lover2Name}'s Mom: (Begins to open the door) Are you sure?

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: Yeah, yeah. I'm just changing.
<<darken 1>>

{$lover2Name}'s mom stops opening the door and walks away. {$lover2Name} and {$lover1Name} look at each other. 

<<lighten 1>>
{$lover2Name}: <size=50%>We need to leave.</size>
<<darken 1>>
They leave through the window with whatever they have packed so far.

===
